//! task: write
//! ask: Declare a named set of capabilities.
//! expect: ok
//! refs: §4.5
//! explain: `potestas` ("power") names a set of capability atoms so a long `poscit` list can be written once. The atoms are identifiers in the capability namespace, not reserved words: `Mundus alloc sermo horologium archivum rete fortuna ambitus Filum machina Crudum`.

potestas Hospes = { alloc, ambitus }
